		(property "Description" "Samsung KLM8G1GETF-B041 eMMC 5.1, 8 GB, 153-ball FBGA 11.5 x 13 mm, 0.5 mm pitch. Same ball map as KLMAG1JETD-B041 (16 GB), KLMBG2JETD-B041 (32 GB) and KLMCG4JETD-B041 (64 GB). Pin numbers are the balls, names verbatim from datasheet Rev. 1.21 [Table 2] (its `Data Strobe` is `Data_Strobe`: KiCad pin names hold no spaces); the 120 balls the table does not name are RFU or unused and carry the name NC -- leave every one unconnected. Generated by tools/gen_emmc_symbol.py; see docs/sic.md 6.1."
